  {
    "hotel_id": "2543107",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/alexa-hostel/hotel/chiang-mai-th.html",
    "name": "ALEXA Nimman Hostel",
    "detail": "Stayed here for my first two nights in Chiang Mai before I got my own apartment. If you a re a digital nomad, I can't recommend this place highly enough. There were no backpackers or party animals here. It's super clean. I had a bed in a dorm with-out bunkbeds. 3 walls and a curtain with locker space under the bed. Was very comfy and quiet with power outlets compatible for Irish/UK, Europe and American plugs. Location wise, its fantastic, right in the middle of a number of co-working spaces and tons of cool and interesting cafés and restaurants in the neighbourhood. Would stay again and maybe even longer than two nights. ",
